### M2.8 — Form-check Edge Function + feedback display

**Goal:** After video upload, a server-side function (code that runs in Supabase's cloud, not on the phone) calls OpenAI and saves coaching feedback to the database. The feedback appears on screen.

**Build prompt:**

```
PART A — Edge Function (server-side, no secrets in the app)

Create supabase/functions/form-check/index.ts:

import { serve } from 'https://deno.land/std@0.177.0/http/server.ts';
import { createClient } from 'https://esm.sh/@supabase/supabase-js@2';

serve(async (req) => {
  // 1. Authenticate the caller using their JWT (login token)
  const authHeader = req.headers.get('Authorization');
  if (!authHeader) return new Response('Unauthorized', { status: 401 });

  const userClient = createClient(
    Deno.env.get('SUPABASE_URL')!,
    Deno.env.get('SUPABASE_ANON_KEY')!,
    { global: { headers: { Authorization: authHeader } } }
  );
  const { data: { user } } = await userClient.auth.getUser();
  if (!user) return new Response('Unauthorized', { status: 401 });

  const admin = createClient(
    Deno.env.get('SUPABASE_URL')!,
    Deno.env.get('SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY')! // service-role key: only safe inside Edge Functions
  );

  // 2. Check active subscription
  const { data: sub } = await admin
    .from('subscriptions')
    .select('status')
    .eq('member_id', user.id)
    .eq('status', 'active')
    .maybeSingle();
  if (!sub) return new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: 'Subscription required' }), {
    status: 402, headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }
  });

  // 3. Rate limit: max 5 form checks per calendar day
  const { videoId } = await req.json();
  const today = new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0];
  const { count } = await admin
    .from('videos')
    .select('id', { count: 'exact', head: true })
    .eq('member_id', user.id)
    .neq('id', videoId)                          // exclude the current video
    .gte('created_at', today + 'T00:00:00.000Z')
    .lte('created_at', today + 'T23:59:59.999Z');
  if ((count ?? 0) >= 5) return new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: 'Daily limit reached (5 checks per day)' }), {
    status: 429, headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }
  });

  // 4. Fetch video row (confirm it belongs to this user)
  const { data: video } = await admin
    .from('videos')
    .select('storage_path')
    .eq('id', videoId)
    .eq('member_id', user.id)
    .single();
  if (!video) return new Response('Not found', { status: 404 });

  // 5. Create a signed URL (expires in 60 seconds) so OpenAI can fetch the video
  const { data: signed } = await admin.storage
    .from('videos')
    .createSignedUrl(video.storage_path, 60);
  if (!signed?.signedUrl) return new Response('Storage error', { status: 500 });

  // 6. Call OpenAI vision model (GPT-4o)
  const openaiRes = await fetch('https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions', {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: {
      'Content-Type': 'application/json',
      'Authorization': `Bearer ${Deno.env.get('OPENAI_API_KEY')}`,
    },
    body: JSON.stringify({
      model: 'gpt-4o',
      messages: [{
        role: 'user',
        content: [
          {
            type: 'text',
            text: 'You are a strength and conditioning coach. Watch this short gym form video and give 2–3 specific, actionable coaching tips in plain English. Be encouraging but honest. Maximum 100 words.',
          },
          { type: 'image_url', image_url: { url: signed.signedUrl } },
        ],
      }],
      max_tokens: 200,
    }),
  });
  const openaiData = await openaiRes.json();
  const feedback = openaiData.choices?.[0]?.message?.content ?? 'No feedback available.';

  // 7. Save feedback to the videos row
  await admin.from('videos').update({ feedback }).eq('id', videoId);

  return new Response(JSON.stringify({ feedback }), {
    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
  });
});

Deploy the function:
  supabase functions deploy form-check --no-verify-jwt

Set these secrets in Supabase dashboard → Settings → Edge Functions → Secrets:
  OPENAI_API_KEY  = sk-...your-key...
(SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY are set automatically.)

PART B — Call from the app (in app/workout/[id].tsx)

After inserting the video row and clearing the spinner, call the Edge Function:

